/*
 Bit Manipulation
 * - Check if power of 2:    (n > 0 && (n & (n - 1)) == 0)
 * - Clear lowest set bit:   n & (n - 1)
 * - Get lowest set bit:     n & -n
 * - Check if i-th bit set:  (n & (1LL << i)) != 0
 * - Set i-th bit:           n | (1LL << i)
 * - Clear i-th bit:         n & ~(1LL << i)
 * - Toggle i-th bit:        n ^ (1LL << i)
 */

